00:08.198" end="00:08.520">まっ</span><span begin="00:08.520" end="00:08.709">た</span><span begin="00:08.709" end="00:09.273">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你究竟去了哪里</span></p><p begin="00:09.942" end="00:12.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:09.942" end="00:10.644">いつも</span><span begin="00:10.644" end="00:11.238">探</span><span begin="00:11.238" end="00:11.873">すんだ</span><span begin="00:11.873" end="00:12.750">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在寻找你</span></p><p begin="00:13.220" end="00:15.143" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:13.220" end="00:13.851">思い</span><span begin="00:13.851" end="00:14.321">出す</span><span begin="00:14.446" end="00:14.643">の</span><span begin="00:14.643" end="00:15.143">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回想起你的歌曲</span></p><p begin="00:15.183" end="00:16.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:15.183" end="00:15.863">君の</span><span begin="00:15.863" end="00:16.401">歌</span></p><p begin="00:16.401" end="00:19.606" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:16.401" end="00:16.935">歌い</span><span begin="00:16.935" end="00:17.503">笑う</span><span begin="00:17.633" end="00:18.036">顔</span><span begin="00:18.036" end="00:18.359">が</span><span begin="00:18.420" end="00:19.295">鮮明</span><span begin="00:19.295" end="00:19.606">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">歌唱欢笑的模样如此鲜明</span></p><p begin="00:19.624" end="00:22.051" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:19.624" end="00:20.396">君に</span><span begin="00:20.396" end="00:20.752">似</span><span begin="00:20.752" end="00:21.499">合うんだ</span><span begin="00:21.499" end="00:22.051">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和你十分契合哦</span></p><p begin="00:22.789" end="00:25.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:22.789" end="00:23.213">ずっ</span><span begin="00:23.213" end="00:24.074">と見てい</span><span begin="00:24.074" end="00:24.735">たい</span><span begin="00:24.735" end="00:25.778">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我多想一直看着你</span></p><p begin="00:26.166" end="00:29.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:26.166" end="00:26.636">でも</span><span begin="00:26.636" end="00:27.233">最</span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.492">後</span><span begin="00:27.492" end="00:28.034">に</span><span begin="00:28.172" end="00:28.862">見たいの</span><span begin="00:28.862" end="00:29.138">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是最后我想看到的</span></p><p begin="00:29.178" end="00:32.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:29.178" end="00:29.603">きっ</span><span begin="00:29.603" end="00:29.801">と</span><span begin="00:29.801" end="00:30.447">もう</span><span begin="00:30.548" end="00:30.895">君</span><span begin="00:30.895" end="00:31.262">の</span><span begin="00:31.388" end="00:31.917">夢の</span><span begin="00:31.917" end="00:32.374">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定已经在你的梦中</span></p><p begin="00:32.374" end="00:33.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:32.374" end="00:33.123">もう一</span><span begin="00:33.123" end="00:33.514">度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次</span></p><p begin="00:33.607" end="00:36.715" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:33.607" end="00:33.812">ま</span><span begin="00:33.812" end="00:34.368">た</span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:35.099">聞かせ</span><span begin="00:35.099" end="00:35.525">て</span><span begin="00:35.525" end="00:35.897">く</span><span begin="00:35.897" end="00:36.100">れ</span><span begin="00:36.100" end="00:36.715">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我再听一次吧</span></p><p begin="00:36.824" end="00:38.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:36.824" end="00:37.281">聞き</span><span begin="00:37.281" end="00:37.753">たいん</span><span begin="00:37.753" end="00:38.136">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还想听更多</span></p><p begin="00:38.568" end="00:39.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:38.568" end="00:39.068">もっ</span><span begin="00:39.068" end="00:39.801">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喧闹吧 怪兽之歌 还不会消失</span></p><p begin="00:39.374" end="00:43.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:39.374" end="00:40.664">騒げ</span><span begin="00:40.664" end="00:41.856">怪獣の</span><span begin="00:41.856" end="00:43.434">歌</span></p><p begin="00:43.784" end="00:45.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:43.784" end="00:44.111">ま</span><span begin="00:44.111" end="00:44.635">だ</span><span begin="00:44.635" end="00:44.876">消</span><span begin="00:44.876" end="00:45.432">え</span><span begin="00:45.432" end="00:45.811">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱着还没有消失的梦之歌</span></p><p begin="00:45.811" end="00:50.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:45.811" end="00:47.094">夢の</span><span begin="00:47.094" end="00:47.770">歌</span><span begin="00:47.878" end="00:48.555">唱</span><span begin="00:48.555" end="00:48.738">え</span><span begin="00:48.738" end="00:50.267">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱起梦的歌曲</span></p><p begin="00:50.772" end="00:52.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:50.772" end="00:51.519">君が</span><span begin="00:51.519" end="00:51.843">い</span><span begin="00:51.843" end="00:51.965">つ</span><span begin="00:51.965" end="00:52.521">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是爱唱怪兽的歌曲</span></p><p begin="00:52.181" end="00:56.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="00:52.181" end="00:53.532">歌う</span><span begin="00:53.532" end="00:54.652">怪獣の</span><span begin="00:54.652" end="00:56.338">歌</span></p><p begin="00:56.588" end="00:58.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="00:56.588" end="00:56.915">ま</span><span begin="00:56.915" end="00:57.439">だ</span><span begin="00:57.439" end="00:57.680">消</span><span begin="00:57.680" end="00:58.236">え</span><span begin="00:58.236" end="00:58.615">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">歌声还未消失</span></p><p begin="00:58.604" end="01:02.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="00:58.604" end="00:59.513">口</span><span begin="00:59.513" end="01:01.011">ずさんで</span><span begin="01:01.011" end="01:01.457">しまう</span><span begin="01:01.457" end="01:02.684">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我下意识便会哼起</span></p><p begin="01:04.388" end="01:06.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:04.388" end="01:05.019">思い</span><span begin="01:05.019" end="01:05.489">出す</span><span begin="01:05.614" end="01:05.811">の</span><span begin="01:05.811" end="01:06.311">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回想起来</span></p><p begin="01:06.358" end="01:07.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:06.358" end="01:07.263">君がい</span><span begin="01:07.263" end="01:07.579">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾有你在</span></p><p begin="01:07.579" end="01:09.633" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:07.579" end="01:07.850">ギ</span><span begin="01:07.850" end="01:08.282">ター</span><span begin="01:08.282" end="01:08.789">持っ</span><span begin="01:08.872" end="01:09.182">て</span><span begin="01:09.182" end="01:09.633">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抱着吉他</span></p><p begin="01:09.633" end="01:10.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:09.633" end="01:10.538">君がい</span><span begin="01:10.538" end="01:10.854">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾有你在</span></p><p begin="01:10.850" end="01:13.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:10.850" end="01:11.517">忘れ</span><span begin="01:11.517" end="01:11.929">ら</span><span begin="01:11.929" end="01:12.145">れ</span><span begin="01:12.145" end="01:12.703">ないんだ</span><span begin="01:12.703" end="01:13.352">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法忘怀</span></p><p begin="01:13.939" end="01:16.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:13.939" end="01:14.684">だから</span><span begin="01:14.684" end="01:15.320">僕が</span><span begin="01:15.320" end="01:15.790">歌</span><span begin="01:15.790" end="01:15.965">う</span><span begin="01:15.965" end="01:16.890">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我要歌唱</span></p><p begin="01:17.381" end="01:20.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:17.381" end="01:17.851">でも</span><span begin="01:17.851" end="01:18.448">最</span><span begin="01:18.545" end="01:18.707">後</span><span begin="01:18.707" end="01:19.249">に</span><span begin="01:19.387" end="01:20.077">見たいの</span><span begin="01:20.077" end="01:20.353">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是最后我想看到的</span></p><p begin="01:20.361" end="01:23.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:20.361" end="01:20.786">きっ</span><span begin="01:20.786" end="01:20.984">と</span><span begin="01:20.984" end="01:21.630">もう</span><span begin="01:21.731" end="01:22.078">君</span><span begin="01:22.078" end="01:22.445">の</span><span begin="01:22.571" end="01:23.100">夢の</span><span begin="01:23.100" end="01:23.557">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定已经在你的梦中</span></p><p begin="01:23.601" end="01:24.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:23.601" end="01:24.350">もう一</span><span begin="01:24.350" end="01:24.741">度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次</span></p><p begin="01:24.807" end="01:27.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:24.807" end="01:25.012">ま</span><span begin="01:25.012" end="01:25.568">た</span><span begin="01:25.640" end="01:26.299">聞かせ</span><span begin="01:26.299" end="01:26.725">て</span><span begin="01:26.725" end="01:27.097">く</span><span begin="01:27.097" end="01:27.300">れ</span><span begin="01:27.300" end="01:27.915">よ</span><span ttm:role="